# What must never enter this repository

# The helper's own settings: a path, a port, an endpoint.  Per machine, never shared,
# useless anywhere else, and nothing in the archive depends on it.
settings.json
settings.json.tmp

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Archives are NEVER versioned here.  An archive has its own backup story -- snapshots,
# rotation and an air gap (tessera_bag.py) -- and one of its own rules is that history is
# never rewritten, which is the opposite of what git does to a file.  Keep archives out of
# this directory, or under one of these names if you must test here:
*/archive/
*Archive/
